1
00:01:50,110 --> 00:01:52,710
{\an8}[A Good Day to Ascend]

2
00:01:54,539 --> 00:01:59,890
{\an8}[Previously on A Good Day to Ascend]

3
00:01:55,320 --> 00:01:56,160
Kill him!

4
00:02:00,720 --> 00:02:01,839
Save...

5
00:02:01,840 --> 00:02:04,319
He's a high-ranking official
serving under the Governor of Yongzhou.

6
00:02:04,320 --> 00:02:05,650
That Judicial Adviser?

7
00:02:06,400 --> 00:02:09,400
You've killed so many men
of the Yongzhou Prefecture.

8
00:02:09,680 --> 00:02:11,240
You deserve to die.

9
00:02:13,760 --> 00:02:15,079
I wonder whether there will be

10
00:02:15,080 --> 00:02:17,040
any changes if I put on this mask.

11
00:02:18,850 --> 00:02:20,269
We need to rescue Yuanqi first.

12
00:02:20,270 --> 00:02:21,959
Going against the will of Heaven,

13
00:02:21,960 --> 00:02:22,959
one becomes an immortal.

14
00:02:22,960 --> 00:02:24,219
This Nuo Immortal

15
00:02:24,220 --> 00:02:26,420
is a dead man that's full of resentment!

16
00:02:27,329 --> 00:02:32,290
{\an8}[Episode 20: Phantom]

17
00:02:33,680 --> 00:02:35,920
Young man from the outside world,

18
00:02:36,360 --> 00:02:38,090
why do you have to hide up there?

19
00:02:38,660 --> 00:02:40,420
I've set up a pulpit to preach.

20
00:02:40,520 --> 00:02:42,200
Regardless of races

21
00:02:42,510 --> 00:02:43,910
and cultivation levels,

22
00:02:44,110 --> 00:02:45,670
anyone can come and learn.

23
00:02:47,560 --> 00:02:48,560
Immortal Master.

24
00:02:49,240 --> 00:02:50,760
I am fine up here.

25
00:02:50,920 --> 00:02:52,250
I can hear more clearly.

26
00:02:53,329 --> 00:02:55,279
Ying, you're here!

27
00:02:55,280 --> 00:02:57,610
This Immortal Master is really good to me.

28
00:02:57,760 --> 00:02:59,760
He's very patient when preaching.

29
00:02:59,930 --> 00:03:01,679
He's much more patient than you are.

30
00:03:01,680 --> 00:03:02,279
Oh, by the way,

31
00:03:02,280 --> 00:03:04,639
he also gave me two scrolls of scriptures.

32
00:03:04,640 --> 00:03:06,119
Ying, you are smart.

33
00:03:06,120 --> 00:03:07,650
Come down at once and learn.

34
00:03:08,320 --> 00:03:09,000
I'll pass.

35
00:03:09,510 --> 00:03:10,870
I am dull-witted,

36
00:03:11,270 --> 00:03:13,470
so I won't trouble the Immortal Master.

37
00:03:17,620 --> 00:03:19,140
Dull-witted?

38
00:03:19,840 --> 00:03:20,440
Alright.

39
00:03:20,920 --> 00:03:22,120
Alright.

40
00:03:23,090 --> 00:03:24,490
Then forget it.

41
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:25,840
You may leave.

42
00:03:26,320 --> 00:03:27,650
Why is there an opening?

43
00:03:28,480 --> 00:03:31,040
I think it's empty inside.

44
00:03:31,440 --> 00:03:33,560
Take this snake demon away, too.

45
00:03:36,320 --> 00:03:36,920
Yuanqi.

46
00:03:37,640 --> 00:03:38,500
Stop learning.

47
00:03:39,200 --> 00:03:41,530
The Immortal Master is asking us to leave.

48
00:03:41,760 --> 00:03:42,840
Come out at once.

49
00:03:43,440 --> 00:03:44,760
The sun is setting.

50
00:03:46,560 --> 00:03:47,539
I was listening just now

51
00:03:47,540 --> 00:03:48,799
and got the hang of it.

52
00:03:48,800 --> 00:03:50,400
I want to stay here and learn.

53
00:03:52,560 --> 00:03:53,400
I won't learn.

54
00:03:54,329 --> 00:03:55,590
Are you leaving or not?

55
00:03:55,880 --> 00:03:56,940
It's getting dark.

56
00:03:57,320 --> 00:03:59,119
This place is surrounded
by the Phantom Realm,

57
00:03:59,120 --> 00:04:00,609
with Phantom Deities roaming here.

58
00:04:00,610 --> 00:04:03,410
Be careful,
or you might not be able to return home.

59
00:04:03,680 --> 00:04:05,649
If you are afraid of spirits,
just go back first.

60
00:04:05,650 --> 00:04:08,710
I will stay with the Immortal Master
for a few more days.

61
00:04:10,010 --> 00:04:11,340
There is a problem here.

62
00:04:11,550 --> 00:04:12,610
What problem is it?

63
00:04:13,560 --> 00:04:16,328
Have you noticed those stone statues
on the immortal mountains?

64
00:04:16,329 --> 00:04:17,170
Mr. Xiao and I

65
00:04:17,269 --> 00:04:19,609
went to check
those several immortal mountains

66
00:04:19,610 --> 00:04:21,540
and found many giant stone statues

67
00:04:21,680 --> 00:04:24,810
that had been carved
into the shapes of various deities.

68
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:27,399
You guys found the soul-summoning elegies?

69
00:04:27,400 --> 00:04:29,239
They were soul-summoning elegies indeed.

70
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:30,840
I couldn't figure out before

71
00:04:31,140 --> 00:04:34,079
why the Immortal Realm
needed soul-summoning elegies.

72
00:04:34,080 --> 00:04:35,729
When you mentioned
the Phantom Realm just now,

73
00:04:35,730 --> 00:04:37,250
I suddenly understood.

74
00:04:37,460 --> 00:04:38,520
I understand, too.

75
00:04:38,840 --> 00:04:40,230
So that's how it is.

76
00:04:40,840 --> 00:04:42,640
What have they both understood?

77
00:04:42,760 --> 00:04:43,680
I don't know.

78
00:04:44,960 --> 00:04:46,080
After sunset,

79
00:04:46,440 --> 00:04:47,339
the zone of the dilapidated temple

80
00:04:47,340 --> 00:04:49,119
will be inside the Phantom Realm,

81
00:04:49,120 --> 00:04:50,759
and ghosts will be everywhere.

82
00:04:50,760 --> 00:04:53,059
The soul-summoning elegies
in the deity statues' heads

83
00:04:53,060 --> 00:04:56,869
are used to summon wandering ghosts
for the refinement of panaceas.

84
00:04:56,870 --> 00:04:59,279
Those deity statues are servants
of the White-Clothed Nuo Immortal.

85
00:04:59,280 --> 00:05:00,679
They are responsible for summoning souls

86
00:05:00,680 --> 00:05:02,010
and refining panaceas.

87
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:06,229
So the deity statues
don't need deity souls to reside in them.

88
00:05:06,230 --> 00:05:07,560
They can just be hollow.

89
00:05:08,120 --> 00:05:10,299
When the Great Temple Zone
is in the Phantom Realm,

90
00:05:10,300 --> 00:05:12,339
there will be souls
residing in them naturally,

91
00:05:12,340 --> 00:05:14,470
and all the deity statues will revive,

92
00:05:14,560 --> 00:05:16,160
becoming powerful deities.

93
00:05:17,530 --> 00:05:18,570
That means...

94
00:05:19,720 --> 00:05:21,899
when the sun sets
in the outside world,

95
00:05:21,900 --> 00:05:25,099
the Nai River will reappear,
the Phantom Realm will invade,

96
00:05:25,100 --> 00:05:28,119
and the Great Temple Zone
will return to the Phantom Realm.

97
00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:30,050
All the deity statues will revive.

98
00:05:31,880 --> 00:05:33,080
They are about to

99
00:05:34,240 --> 00:05:35,360
start a massacre.

100
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:38,640
Yuan,

101
00:05:39,530 --> 00:05:41,189
this place is about to fall into danger.

102
00:05:41,190 --> 00:05:42,450
You guys should leave.

103
00:05:43,420 --> 00:05:44,550
Aren't you leaving?

104
00:05:44,920 --> 00:05:45,920
My friend is here.

105
00:05:46,250 --> 00:05:47,210
How can I leave?

106
00:05:47,840 --> 00:05:49,399
Yuan, if you have time in the future,

107
00:05:49,400 --> 00:05:51,530
you can go to Mount Prudence to find me.

108
00:05:52,850 --> 00:05:54,580
Why do you have to go seek death?

109
00:05:54,960 --> 00:05:56,520
Young Master, let's go.

110
00:05:59,440 --> 00:06:02,439
I'm here to learn
the Immortal Master's knowledge, too.

111
00:06:02,440 --> 00:06:03,690
Criminal Xu Ying!

112
00:06:04,480 --> 00:06:07,280
Even though you've escaped
into the great temple,

113
00:06:07,540 --> 00:06:09,540
you can't escape the net of justice.

114
00:06:10,910 --> 00:06:11,680
My Lord.

115
00:06:12,240 --> 00:06:13,970
He's the Governor of Yongzhou.

116
00:06:14,350 --> 00:06:15,270
I was careless.

117
00:06:15,660 --> 00:06:17,720
I didn't notice that he was also here.

118
00:06:18,840 --> 00:06:20,900
And Deputy Prefect Ling is here, too.

119
00:06:22,720 --> 00:06:23,680
Xu Ying is here.

120
00:06:24,170 --> 00:06:25,200
Shall we...

121
00:06:26,020 --> 00:06:27,820
Xu Ying is nothing.

122
00:06:28,440 --> 00:06:31,269
He can merely crack
the demon race's cultivation techniques.

123
00:06:31,270 --> 00:06:33,769
What I've been practicing
is immortal magic.

124
00:06:33,770 --> 00:06:34,900
Stop making a noise!

125
00:06:35,270 --> 00:06:37,730
Don't disturb my ascension to immortality.

126
00:06:38,240 --> 00:06:39,170
Deputy Prefect.

127
00:06:39,380 --> 00:06:40,320
Xu Ying...

128
00:06:43,010 --> 00:06:45,869
Why do you guys have to
disturb my immortal destiny?

129
00:06:45,870 --> 00:06:47,289
I entered the temple

130
00:06:47,290 --> 00:06:48,669
to learn immortal magic.

131
00:06:48,670 --> 00:06:50,019
Even that annoying fat guy, Governor Zhou,

132
00:06:50,020 --> 00:06:51,819
doesn't want to deal with him anymore.

133
00:06:51,820 --> 00:06:55,480
Why are you guys using Xu Ying
to disturb my peaceful cultivation?

134
00:06:57,530 --> 00:07:00,809
What are you guys trying to achieve
with all these injuries?

135
00:07:00,810 --> 00:07:03,269
Immortal Master,
I wonder if you know swordsmanship.

136
00:07:03,270 --> 00:07:04,699
I'm learning swordsmanship.

137
00:07:04,700 --> 00:07:06,100
Ying.

138
00:07:06,230 --> 00:07:08,639
How could the Immortal Master
not know swordsmanship?

139
00:07:08,640 --> 00:07:09,569
Outside the Shuikou Temple,

140
00:07:09,570 --> 00:07:12,159
the Sword-Energy Abyss,
which is over 10 miles long,

141
00:07:12,160 --> 00:07:14,439
was created by the Immortal Master
with his swordsmanship.

142
00:07:14,440 --> 00:07:15,079
Is that right,

143
00:07:15,080 --> 00:07:16,080
Immortal Master?

144
00:07:16,210 --> 00:07:18,789
The Immortal Master
actually doesn't know swordsmanship.

145
00:07:18,790 --> 00:07:20,050
You are a Nuo Immortal.

146
00:07:20,760 --> 00:07:22,729
When you felt your lifespan was exhausted,

147
00:07:22,730 --> 00:07:25,130
you hid in your own place
of transformation

148
00:07:25,570 --> 00:07:28,359
and enslaved those deity statues
to refine panaceas

149
00:07:28,360 --> 00:07:30,560
for the maintenance of your deity soul.

150
00:07:30,800 --> 00:07:31,680
But one day,

151
00:07:32,300 --> 00:07:34,859
a flash of sword light
split open your place of transformation

152
00:07:34,860 --> 00:07:36,700
and killed you right here.

153
00:07:37,520 --> 00:07:40,050
Xu Ying,
what nonsense are you talking about?

154
00:07:40,680 --> 00:07:42,240
What an ignorant brat!

155
00:07:43,480 --> 00:07:45,219
Immortal Master, please forgive him.

156
00:07:45,220 --> 00:07:47,279
There's something wrong with his brain.

157
00:07:47,280 --> 00:07:49,680
He can't even remember
who his parents are.

158
00:07:50,570 --> 00:07:51,700
You desire rebirth.

159
00:07:52,230 --> 00:07:53,949
But you probably can't directly use

160
00:07:53,950 --> 00:07:55,610
the flesh and blood of others.

161
00:07:55,909 --> 00:07:57,799
You need to
teach them cultivation techniques

162
00:07:57,800 --> 00:08:00,259
so that they can practice
your evil techniques on their own

163
00:08:00,260 --> 00:08:03,190
and transform themselves
to be suitable for your...

164
00:08:04,680 --> 00:08:05,600
Possession!

165
00:08:08,010 --> 00:08:09,839
A physical body is like a house,

166
00:08:09,840 --> 00:08:11,640
and a soul is like a resident.

167
00:08:11,750 --> 00:08:13,729
Taking over someone else's body

168
00:08:13,730 --> 00:08:15,650
is called possession.

169
00:08:16,530 --> 00:08:17,799
You've been using evil techniques

170
00:08:17,800 --> 00:08:19,049
to make these pathetic wretches

171
00:08:19,050 --> 00:08:21,639
transform themselves into physical bodies
that are suitable for your possession.

172
00:08:21,640 --> 00:08:22,440
Right?

173
00:08:23,440 --> 00:08:24,800
Boy,

174
00:08:25,280 --> 00:08:28,800
do you know what you're talking about?

175
00:08:30,040 --> 00:08:32,240
Of course I know what I'm talking about.

176
00:08:32,980 --> 00:08:34,059
I also know

177
00:08:35,400 --> 00:08:36,520
what killed you

178
00:08:36,919 --> 00:08:38,280
was this move!

179
00:08:49,320 --> 00:08:50,680
I didn't expect that

180
00:08:51,200 --> 00:08:53,280
you could actually use this move.

181
00:08:54,010 --> 00:08:56,970
It's a pity that it's too weak.

182
00:08:57,360 --> 00:08:59,000
The sun is setting.

183
00:08:59,270 --> 00:09:01,390
You guys can't get out.

184
00:09:10,040 --> 00:09:10,840
Let's go!

185
00:09:11,340 --> 00:09:12,740
It's going to be too late.

186
00:09:13,490 --> 00:09:15,440
Oh, my God! What is that?

187
00:09:28,500 --> 00:09:31,360
At last, darkness has fallen.

188
00:09:35,020 --> 00:09:37,490
The massacre begins now.

189
00:09:39,200 --> 00:09:40,800
My divine dynasty

190
00:09:42,110 --> 00:09:44,510
has awakened!

191
00:09:45,970 --> 00:09:46,970
All of you

192
00:09:47,720 --> 00:09:49,640
are sacrifices.

193
00:09:50,570 --> 00:09:51,370
Run!

194
00:10:07,920 --> 00:10:09,440
Let the souls disperse!

195
00:10:09,860 --> 00:10:13,340
This door has been sealed
with a blood curse.

196
00:10:16,720 --> 00:10:18,059
You've practiced my

197
00:10:18,060 --> 00:10:20,199
Detailed Explanation
of Daoist Truth and Xuanji,

198
00:10:20,200 --> 00:10:21,930
and now you even want to get out?

199
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:27,960
If we let this guy absorb everyone,

200
00:10:28,290 --> 00:10:30,239
I'm afraid we'll never
be able to escape from here.

201
00:10:30,240 --> 00:10:31,459
We have to think of a way.

202
00:10:31,460 --> 00:10:33,460
Immortal Master! Immortal Master!

203
00:10:34,220 --> 00:10:35,379
Previously, when we were practicing,

204
00:10:35,380 --> 00:10:38,189
someone said he felt more in tune
with the Immortal Realm.

205
00:10:38,190 --> 00:10:38,830
Actually,

206
00:10:39,320 --> 00:10:41,079
he was just fusing himself
with this temple

207
00:10:41,080 --> 00:10:42,940
through the cultivation, right?

208
00:10:43,890 --> 00:10:46,770
Stupid snake, you are quite lucky.

209
00:10:47,320 --> 00:10:48,379
But...

210
00:10:48,380 --> 00:10:51,209
Immortal Master! Immortal Master!

211
00:10:51,210 --> 00:10:54,490
You told me about something
called Dao Explanation.

212
00:10:54,680 --> 00:10:57,079
Detailed Explanation
of Daoist Truth and Xuanji.

213
00:10:57,080 --> 00:10:59,099
You said the Detailed Explanation
of Daoist Truth and Xuanji

214
00:10:59,100 --> 00:11:00,229
required flowing in reverse.

215
00:11:00,230 --> 00:11:03,039
Otherwise, we would only stray further
from the path to immortality.

216
00:11:03,040 --> 00:11:04,240
Does that mean

217
00:11:04,340 --> 00:11:05,879
by following the natural course
of the cultivation technique,

218
00:11:05,880 --> 00:11:08,810
we can disconnect ourselves
from this great temple?

219
00:11:23,760 --> 00:11:24,720
Snake!

220
00:11:25,160 --> 00:11:26,799
Since you've ruined my plan,

221
00:11:26,800 --> 00:11:28,789
I will make you die a horrible death!

222
00:11:28,790 --> 00:11:29,519
My God!

223
00:11:29,520 --> 00:11:30,280
Run!

224
00:11:36,200 --> 00:11:37,200
I got it.

225
00:11:37,380 --> 00:11:39,389
He has also fused himself with
the great temple through the cultivation

226
00:11:39,390 --> 00:11:40,600
to stay undead.

227
00:11:40,970 --> 00:11:42,770
He can't leave the great temple.

228
00:11:48,030 --> 00:11:52,470
You wretched snake!

229
00:12:21,390 --> 00:12:23,030
Merge with me

230
00:12:23,130 --> 00:12:24,580
and become me.

231
00:12:24,890 --> 00:12:26,850
I will give you supreme glory

232
00:12:27,120 --> 00:12:29,200
and eternal life.

233
00:12:35,430 --> 00:12:38,960
Speaking of that sword-playing brat
and the rascally snake...

234
00:12:39,110 --> 00:12:41,870
where are you two?

235
00:12:45,350 --> 00:12:46,990
{\an8}[The Bull-Headed Deity, Mou Mou]

236
00:13:08,600 --> 00:13:09,760
Monster, go to hell!

237
00:13:22,730 --> 00:13:23,680
Coward!

238
00:13:23,920 --> 00:13:25,920
You even want to attack me sneakily?

239
00:13:27,790 --> 00:13:30,759
This is the place of transformation
for my Hidden Manifestation.

240
00:13:30,760 --> 00:13:33,799
All things here
are manifestations of my divine power.

241
00:13:33,800 --> 00:13:35,840
You guys want to deal with me here?

242
00:13:36,340 --> 00:13:37,820
That's ridiculous!

243
00:14:04,910 --> 00:14:06,170
Ying, he's behind you!

244
00:14:06,840 --> 00:14:07,649
Mr. Bell!

245
00:14:07,650 --> 00:14:08,370
Yuanqi!

246
00:14:08,660 --> 00:14:10,220
Wait for me at the entrance
of the Shuikou Temple!

247
00:14:10,120 --> 00:14:11,900
{\an8}[The Ghost-Faced Deity, Qi]

248
00:14:10,410 --> 00:14:11,330
Okay!

249
00:14:13,400 --> 00:14:16,660
Ying is a good person,
so he'll surely be blessed by Heaven.

250
00:16:03,140 --> 00:16:04,420
They actually...

251
00:16:11,610 --> 00:16:13,709
managed to kill
the Judicial Adviser of Yongzhou,

252
00:16:13,710 --> 00:16:14,590
Zhou Zheng.

253
00:16:18,610 --> 00:16:19,410
Oh, no.

254
00:16:20,150 --> 00:16:21,510
This is fatal.

255
00:16:47,870 --> 00:16:51,980
{\an8}[In the next episode]

256
00:16:49,200 --> 00:16:51,320
Oh, my God!

257
00:16:52,080 --> 00:16:53,559
He's a fraud!

258
00:16:53,560 --> 00:16:55,160
This fraud has the panacea!

259
00:17:00,880 --> 00:17:02,240
Does it really hurt that much?

